OL,3,GNEWSA'Sinn Fein will not walk away from
OL,4,AStormont', says Michelle O'Neill
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Walking away would mean handing
OL,7,Fcontrol of our public services over to
OL,8,FBritish government ministers," she
OL,9,Fcontinued. "That would be disastrous
OL,10,Fand Sinn Fein is not going to do that."
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
